Package: hetfamily
Type: Package
Title: Heterogeneous Treatment Effects Family for jamovi
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mingchao Sun
Maintainer: Mingchao Sun <mingchao.sun@hotmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/hetfamily
BugReports: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/hetfamily/issues
Description: Generic machine learning inference on heterogeneous treatment effects in randomized
    experiments for jamovi (Chernozhukov, Demirer, Duflo and Fernandez-Val): best linear predictor,
    sorted group average treatment effects, classification analysis, and the value of a treatment rule.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 2.3.4),
    R6,
    ggplot2,
    glmnet,
    ranger
